      "le=\"padding-top:36px;padding-bottom:31px;background:#f8f6f1\">\r\n            <div style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#26324a\">Conference season is coming up, and we’d love the opportunity to introduce you to The Adventure Zone. If you’ll be attending <strong>{{conventionName}}</strong>, we’d enjoy learning about your event and what you’re planning for the 2027 season.</div>\r\n            <div style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#26324a;margin-top:15px\">The Adventure Zone provides professional, fully staffed inflatable carnival packages for fairs, festivals, rodeos, and community celebrations. We bring the attractions, trained crew, setup, daily operation, and teardown—giving organizers a colorful, high-capacity experience without having to manage the midway themselves.</div>\r\n                      <div style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#26324a;margin-top:15px\">I noticed <strong style=\"color:#ff0a8a!important;-webkit-text-fill-color:#ff0a8a\">(INSERT A SPECIFIC DETAIL ABOUT THEIR EVENT, THEME, ANNIVERSARY, OR COMMUNITY HERE)</strong>, and it made me especially interested in learning more.</div>\r\n            <div style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#26324a;margin-top:15px\">I’d love to hear how you’re thinking about <strong style=\"color:#ff0a8a!important;-webkit-text-fill-color:#ff0a8a\">(INSERT A SPECIFIC 2027 GOAL OR CHALLENGE HERE)</strong>.</div>\r\n</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"padding:0 14px;background:#f8f6f1\">\r\n            <a href=\"https://youtu.be/MWD0SdAWZpc?is=TwYW3RxUGQxsdfbk\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Watch The Adventure Zone in action\" style=\"display:block;text-decoration:none;border:0;\"><img src=\"https://adventure-zone-command-center-1.onrender.com/assets/adventure-zone-mini-trailer.gif\" width=\"612\" a",
      "lt=\"The Adventure Zone mini trailer — tap to watch the video\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:260px;object-fit:cover;border:2px solid #0f1729;box-sizing:border-box;\"></a>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td class=\"m_4731797326734202227pad\" style=\"padding-top:34px;padding-bottom:34px;background:#f8f6f1\">\r\n            <table role=\"presentation\" class=\"m_4731797326734202227stack\" width=\"100%\">\r\n              <tbody><tr>\r\n                <td width=\"31%\" valign=\"top\" class=\"m_4731797326734202227card\" style=\"padding:18px 15px\">\r\n                  <div style=\"color:#ff0a8a;font-size:22px;font-weight:900\">25+</div>\r\n                  <div style=\"font-size:10px;line-height:14px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.7px;margin-top:4px\">YEARS OF FUN</div>\r\n                </td>\r\n                <td width=\"3.5%\" class=\"m_4731797326734202227gap\"></td>\r\n                <td width=\"31%\" valign=\"top\" class=\"m_4731797326734202227card\" style=\"padding:18px 15px\">\r\n                  <div style=\"color:#ff0a8a;font-size:22px;font-weight:900\">500+</div>\r\n                  <div style=\"font-size:10px;line-height:14px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.7px;margin-top:4px\">EVENTS ATTENDED</div>\r\n                </td>\r\n                <td width=\"3.5%\" class=\"m_4731797326734202227gap\"></td>\r\n                <td width=\"31%\" valign=\"top\" class=\"m_4731797326734202227card\" style=\"padding:18px 15px\">\r\n                  <div style=\"color:#ff0a8a;font-size:22px;font-weight:900\">FULL</div>\r\n                  <div style=\"font-size:10px;line-height:14px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.7px;margin-top:4px\">TURNKEY OPERATION</div>\r\n                </td>\r\n              </tr>\r\n            </tbody></table>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"background:#0f1",
      "729;padding:35px 38px 37px\">\r\n            <div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.2px;color:#ffca05\">BUILT FOR THE BIG DAY</div>\r\n            <div style=\"font-size:29px;line-height:34px;font-weight:900;color:#fff;margin-top:8px\">A package for every kind of adventure.</div>\r\n            <table role=\"presentation\" class=\"m_4731797326734202227stack\" width=\"100%\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">\r\n              <tbody><tr>\r\n                <td width=\"31%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"background:#ff0a8a;border:2px solid #fff\">\r\n                  <a href=\"https://youtu.be/tgjwa1LvghI?is=zJn5BsqWbmQyTpg8\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Watch the Pirate’s Rebellion video\" style=\"display:block;text-decoration:none;border:0;\"><img src=\"https://adventure-zone-command-center-1.onrender.com/assets/pirates-rebellion-paddle-boats.jpg\" width=\"175\" height=\"110\" alt=\"Pirate&#39;s Rebellion paddle boats and event display\" style=\"width:100%;height:110px;object-fit:cover\"></a>\r\n                  <a href=\"https://youtu.be/tgjwa1LvghI?is=zJn5BsqWbmQyTpg8\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block;color:#ffffff !important;-webkit-text-fill-color:#ffffff !important;text-decoration:none;border:0;\"><div style=\"padding:14px 12px 16px;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:900\">PIRATE’S<br>REBELLION</div></a>\r\n                </td>\r\n                <td width=\"3.5%\" class=\"m_4731797326734202227gap\"></td>\r\n                <td width=\"31%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"background:#ff0a8a;border:2px solid #fff\">\r\n                  <a href=\"https://youtu.be/MWD0SdAWZpc?is=TwYW3RxUGQxsdfbk\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Watch the Adventure Zone video\" style=\"display:block;text-decoration:none;border:0;\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/0e6e2c_d18d32eac9704b44a2dc9a1c28f9158b~mv2.jpg\" width=\"175\" hei",
      "ght=\"110\" alt=\"Adventure Zone inflatable carnival package\" style=\"width:100%;height:110px;object-fit:cover\"></a>\r\n                  <a href=\"https://youtu.be/MWD0SdAWZpc?is=TwYW3RxUGQxsdfbk\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block;color:#ffffff !important;-webkit-text-fill-color:#ffffff !important;text-decoration:none;border:0;\"><div style=\"padding:14px 12px 16px;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:900\">ADVENTURE<br>ZONE</div></a>\r\n                </td>\r\n                <td width=\"3.5%\" class=\"m_4731797326734202227gap\"></td>\r\n                <td width=\"31%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"background:#ff0a8a;border:2px solid #fff\">\r\n                  <a href=\"https://youtu.be/-xTjCJz9RmI?feature=shared\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Watch the Warrior’s Playground video\" style=\"display:block;text-decoration:none;border:0;\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/0e6e2c_a25608d697b146ac981ab5b6f074664c~mv2.jpg\" width=\"175\" height=\"110\" alt=\"Warrior&#39;s Playground action attraction\" style=\"width:100%;height:110px;object-fit:cover\"></a>\r\n                  <a href=\"https://youtu.be/-xTjCJz9RmI?feature=shared\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block;color:#ffffff !important;-webkit-text-fill-color:#ffffff !important;text-decoration:none;border:0;\"><div style=\"padding:14px 12px 16px;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:900\">WARRIOR’S<br>PLAYGROUND</div></a>\r\n                </td>\r\n              </tr>\r\n            </tbody></table>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n\r\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:0 38px 34px;background:#f8f6f1\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:#fff4f8;border:2px solid #ff0a8a\"><tr><td style=\"padding:20px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.2px;color:#ff0a8a\">EARLY BIRD",
      "</div><div style=\"margin-top:7px;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:900;color:#0f1729\">Save 10% when your deposit is in by {{earlyBirdDeadline}}</div><div style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#26324a\">This Early Bird offer is available across the upcoming season for a short time, making now a great time to secure your event date.</div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr>\r\n          <td class=\"m_4731797326734202227pad\" style=\"padding-top:37px;padding-bottom:39px;background:#ffca05!important;background-color:#ffca05!important;border-bottom:2px solid #0f1729\">\r\n            <div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.1px;color:#0f1729!important\">WILL WE SEE YOU THERE?</div>\r\n            <div style=\"font-size:30px;line-height:34px;font-weight:900;color:#0f1729!important;margin-top:7px\">Meet us at {{conventionName}}.</div>\r\n            <div style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#0f1729!important;margin-top:12px\">We’ll be there {{conventionDates}} at {{boothOrMeetingLocation}}. Reply with a convenient time to meet, or tell us a little about your event and we’ll be happy to follow up.</div>\r\n            <table role=\"presentation\" class=\"m_4731797326734202227stack\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">\r\n              <tbody><tr>\r\n                <td><a href=\"mailto:TheAdventureZone12@gmail.com?subject=Meeting%20at%20%5BConference%20Name%5D\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 22px;background:#0f1729!important;background-color:#0f1729!important;color:#ffffff!important;border:2px solid #0f1729;font-size:13px;line-height:16px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.7px;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">SCHEDULE A TIME TO MEET  →</a></td>\r\n                <td width=\"15\" class=\"m_4731797326734202227button-gap\">",
      "</td>\r\n                <td><a href=\"https://www.the-adventure-zone.com/\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 22px;background:#0f1729!important;background-color:#0f1729!important;color:#ffffff!important;border:2px solid #0f1729;font-size:13px;line-height:16px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.7px;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">EXPLORE THE WEBSITE</a></td>\r\n              </tr>\r\n            </tbody></table>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td class=\"m_4731797326734202227pad\" style=\"padding-top:31px;padding-bottom:30px;background:#f8f6f1\">\r\n            <div style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#26324a\">We’d love to hear what you have planned for <strong>{{eventName}}</strong> and explore whether The Adventure Zone could be a good fit for your community.</div>\r\n            <div style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#26324a;margin-top:19px\">We hope to meet you at the conference!<br></div>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"background:#0f1729;border-top:5px solid #ff0a8a;padding:25px 38px;text-align:center\">\r\n            <div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:19px;font-weight:700;color:#fff\">The Adventure Zone · America’s Best Inflatable Carnival</div>\r\n            <div class=\"m_4731797326734202227fine\" style=\"color:#cbd2df;margin-top:6px\"><a href=\"mailto:TheAdventureZone12@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">TheAdventureZone12@gmail.com</a> · 435-760-5583 · <a href=\"http://the-adventure-zone.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">the-adventure-zone.com</a></div>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </tbody></table>\r\n    </td></tr>\r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n"
